# Keep the Docker build context small + reproducible. The runtime image build needs only
# docker/entrypoints/ (COPYed) — the pinned source never comes from this context: the build stage
# clones it (url/ref arrive as build args from tools/build_image.sh), or under rig receives the
# tree rig exported as the separate `mavrouter-src` named context. So never the host's vendored
# src/ nor any local state.
.git/
.github/
.claude/
/.rig/
/tests/
/src/
/var/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
